At 00:02.417, Amy stands beside Goblin on the east side of the hall, her rough‑spun linen tunic brushing the wooden floor as she takes a short stride toward the hearth.

At 00:04.117, Amy lifts a handful of liquid from the barrel that sits near the hearth and tilts it toward the goblin’s mug.

